// The Ninth Chimney (bible 8.2): nobody remembers building it. A Guild agent lives at the top: Ostry, a nightjar,
// posted "for a season" to watch the Holdfast. The chimney is anchored; so is he. He has been here twenty-two
// years and thinks it is his first winter (plant 5.1, the Stillness). Chimneys_3.

title: Chimneys_Ninth_Agent
---
<<if has_flag("emberdown.ninth.agent_met")>>
    Ostry: First winter's the hardest, they say. Nearly spring. Then I'm relieved. #still #face:grave #line:0c67952
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Ostry: Ah. You'll be my relief. Early. I was told a season. #face:bright #line:0125819
Ostry: First winter's the hardest, they say. Nearly spring. #plant:5.1 #face:grave #line:0eb2242
-> How long have you been up here? #line:03a0c82
    <<voice surveyor emberdown>>
    Ostry: A season. Since the autumn. The autumn was very long. I keep the log. It says the same thing. #face:grave #line:05097d7
-> Who built this chimney? #line:076ab88
    <<voice warden emberdown>>
    Ostry: The Guild. Well. Somebody surveyed it. Then it was here. I watch the ones who walk. #face:wary #line:0239d33
-> ... #line:037490e
    <<voice drift emberdown>>
    Ostry: You're not my relief. No. Nobody's cowl is that dusty. #face:grave #line:0b5e591
Ostry: If you go down, tell the Observatory: nothing to report. Same as every week. #line:029f1c4
<<flag emberdown.ninth.agent_met 1>>
===
